Package: ccctest
Type: Package
Title: Common Causality of Covariates Tests and Trend Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Sunny Karim (CCC method and project maintenance); Matthew D. Webb (software development collaboration); OpenAI Codex (software implementation assistance)
Maintainer: Sunny Karim <SunnyKarim@cmail.carleton.ca>
Description: Native unweighted Common Causality of Covariates Wald tests,
    additive second-stage Holm selection, and auditable untreated trend
    diagnostics. Based on Sunny Karim's September 2026 manuscript. These
    diagnostics do not establish parallel trends or estimate treatment effects.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices
